{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0135"},"reason":"The Rotunda's original purpose is disputed: Galerius may have meant it as his mausoleum, but other scholars (Discover Greece, The Byzantine Legacy) see a temple of Zeus or the Kabeiroi, and Galerius was buried at Romuliana in Serbia. The body now gives both views instead of \"likely\" a mausoleum.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.thebyzantinelegacy.com/rotunda-thessaloniki"},{"url":"https://audio.discovergreece.com/audio-tour/walking-tour-thessaloniki-culture/pois/the-rotunda"},{"url":"https://religiousgreece.gr/en/attractions/church-agios-georgios-rotunda"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",580],["-","likely"],["+","perhaps"],["=",1],["-","intending it "],["=",8],["-","though"],["+","although"],["=",1],["-","he"],["+","some"],["=",1],["+","scholars think it "],["=",2],["-","ultimately"],["+","meant"],["=",1],["+","as a temple of Zeus or the Kabeiroi; in any case Galerius was "],["=",2],["-","elsewhere."],["+","far"],["=",1],["+","away, in today's Serbia. "],["=",173]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",534],["-","vermutlich"],["+","vielleicht"],["=",5],["-","Mausoleum"],["+","Mausoleum,"],["=",1],["-","gedacht,"],["+","wobei"],["=",1],["-","obwohl"],["+","manche"],["=",1],["-","er"],["+","Forscher"],["=",1],["-","letztlich"],["+","darin"],["=",1],["-","anderswo"],["+","eher"],["=",1],["+","einen Tempel des Zeus oder der Kabiren sehen; "],["=",2],["-","wurde."],["+","wurde"],["=",1],["+","Galerius jedenfalls weit entfernt, im heutigen Serbien. "],["=",157]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",526],["-","вероятно,"],["+","возможно,"],["=",1],["-","задуманную "],["=",8],["-","в"],["+","часть"],["=",1],["-","итоге"],["+","исследователей"],["=",1],["-","похоронили"],["+","считает"],["=",1],["-","его"],["+","её"],["=",1],["-","в"],["+","храмом"],["=",1],["-","другом"],["+","Зевса"],["=",1],["-","месте."],["+","или"],["=",1],["+","кабиров; похоронен Галерий был, во всяком случае, далеко отсюда, на территории современной Сербии. "],["=",157]]}],"hash":"b951212e83a1","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"f70101654d7b257c1f2ea2ff97b8af84b71edabc5f2063b1e8dce02b90b05a9c"},
