{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w00674"},"reason":"The question stated as fact that the Rotunda was \"originally constructed as a mausoleum\", which is disputed. Reworded to the certain facts (built by Galerius c. 300, later a church, then a mosque); the answer stays the same.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.thebyzantinelegacy.com/rotunda-thessaloniki"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which building in Thessaloniki, originally constructed as a mausoleum for the Roman emperor Galerius, was later converted into a church and then a mosque?","new":"Which round brick building in Thessaloniki, erected by the Roman emperor Galerius around 300, was later converted into a church and then a mosque?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welches ursprünglich als Mausoleum für den römischen Kaiser Galerius erbaute Bauwerk in Thessaloniki wurde später zur Kirche und danach zur Moschee umgewidmet?","new":"Welcher um 300 vom römischen Kaiser Galerius errichtete Ziegelrundbau in Thessaloniki wurde später zur Kirche und danach zur Moschee umgewidmet?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какое здание в Салониках, первоначально построенное как мавзолей римского императора Галерия, позднее стало церковью, а затем мечетью?","new":"Какое круглое кирпичное здание в Салониках, возведённое римским императором Галерием около 300 года, позднее стало церковью, а затем мечетью?"}],"hash":"f6cf06d96d49","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"37392aa61216ea32dd2343d5e5f5cc6bda1dc766bf3ae370bb114850db9f4baf"},
